## 6. API Design (REST)

### Auth
- `POST /api/auth/login` (public)
- `POST /api/auth/refresh` (authenticated)
- `POST /api/auth/logout` (authenticated)

### Users & Roles
- `GET /api/users` (ADMIN)
- `POST /api/users` (ADMIN)
- `PUT /api/users/{id}` (ADMIN)
- `DELETE /api/users/{id}` (ADMIN, soft delete)
- `GET /api/roles` (ADMIN)

### Teams
- `GET /api/team` (all authenticated)
- `PUT /api/team` (ADMIN)
- `GET /api/team/members` (all authenticated)

### Events & Attendance
- `GET /api/events` (all authenticated)
- `POST /api/events` (COACH/ADMIN)
- `PUT /api/events/{id}` (COACH/ADMIN)
- `DELETE /api/events/{id}` (COACH/ADMIN cancel)
- `POST /api/events/{id}/responses` (PLAYER)
- `GET /api/events/{id}/responses` (COACH/ADMIN)

### Fine Catalog & Fines
- `GET /api/fine-categories` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `POST /api/fine-categories` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `PUT /api/fine-categories/{id}` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `DELETE /api/fine-categories/{id}` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `GET /api/fines` (role-filtered)
- `POST /api/fines` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `PUT /api/fines/{id}` (ADMIN/COACH)
- `DELETE /api/fines/{id}` (ADMIN/COACH)

### Payments & Treasury
- `GET /api/payments` (ADMIN/TREASURER; player sees own)
- `POST /api/payments` (TREASURER)
- `GET /api/ledger` (ADMIN/TREASURER)
- `POST /api/ledger` (TREASURER)

### Notifications
- `GET /api/notifications` (authenticated)
- `PUT /api/notifications/{id}/read` (owner)

### Reporting
- `GET /api/reports/attendance` (COACH/ADMIN)
- `GET /api/reports/fines` (COACH/ADMIN/TREASURER)
- `GET /api/reports/export` (ADMIN/TREASURER)
- `GET /api/standings/current` (authenticated)

#### Validation and Security Rules
- Request schema validation (DTO + class-validator/Zod)
- Authorization checks per route + resource ownership checks
- Pagination + filtering on list APIs
- Idempotency key for payment callbacks

