## 8. Database Design (Initial Concept)

### Constraints
- Unique: users.email, role.name, participation(event_id,user_id)
- Check: monetary amounts `> 0` where applicable
- FK constraints on all relational links
- Soft-delete strategy for user/fine/event records where audit is required

### Indexing Strategy
- `events(starts_at)`
- `participation(event_id, status)`
- `fines(user_id, status, assigned_at)`
- `payments(paid_at)`
- `audit_log(entity_name, entity_id, created_at)`

### Integrity Rules
- Fine marked PAID only when linked payment allocations cover amount
- Attendance response updates blocked after deadline (unless coach override)
- Ledger always append-only (no destructive edits)

