## 11. Final Technical Recommendation (Target Architecture)

### Stack (Recommended)
- **Frontend**: Vue 3 + TypeScript + Vite
- **Backend**: NestJS + TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL
- **Hosting**: Netlify (frontend) + managed container host for API + managed PostgreSQL
- **Containerization**: Docker (API)
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions (lint/test/build/deploy)

### System Design
- Modular monolith for MVP (clear domain modules)
- REST API with OpenAPI documentation
- Event-driven integration point for notifications

### API Design Principles
- Versioned endpoints (`/api/v1/...` when first breaking change appears)
- Consistent error envelope and validation error format
- Role and ownership checks at controller + service layer

### Database Design Principles
- Relational-first schema with strict constraints
- Auditability for finance-related entities

### Source Control Strategy
- Trunk-based development with short-lived feature branches
- Pull requests + required checks
- Conventional commits for release/readability

### Why this fits the project constraints
- Fast to build in a 2-day window
- Easy to deploy and run
- Simple enough for student maintainability
- Structured enough to extend with new features later

