## 13. Open Questions Blocking Fully Autonomous AI MVP Build

1. Is live Standings web scraping mandatory for MVP runtime, or can it be deferred to scheduled sync/cached data?
2. Should TREASURER be the only role allowed to create payments and ledger entries, or can ADMIN also perform these actions?
3. Are players allowed to see team-wide payment history with identities, or only anonymized/aggregated values?
4. Which GDPR retention window applies to attendance decline reasons and audit records?
